  ('search-cur-trainer-coaching-learning', 'cur-trainer-coaching-learning', 'module', 'Coach the Rep, Protect the Person', 'Use precise evidence, productive struggle, 80/20 questions, and immediate second takes.
Outcomes: Use the 60-Second Coach; Diagnose clarity, skill, system, environment, or willingness; Keep questions and honest uncertainty safe
