Difficult moments: Overwhelmed: ''Tell me the one thing you are trying to control. We will get one clean rep, then add the next piece.''; Defensive: ''I am coaching the behavior I observed. Tell me what you heard the standard to be, then we will rerun.''; Conflicting instructions: ''We are not making you choose between trainers. We will verify the current written standard.''; Trainer unsure: ''I do not want to teach a guess. I will verify and show you where the approved source lives.''; Repeat miss: ''Show me where your process breaks; then we will diagnose clarity, skill, environment, or willingness.''
